      "file": "t58.py",
      "line": 14,
      "evidence": "The code relies on magic bytes but does not validate the filename extension or sanitize the input filename.",
      "llm_reasoning": "Even if the file content is a PNG, an attacker could upload a file with a double extension or malicious name if the filename is used later.",
